<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Moments tab (the detection feed and its cards), tagging a moment's car, "Not a person", the
  home screen's in-view strip, and the clip editor. Keys start with moments_ or clip_.
  See AGENTS.md, "Strings and localization".
-->
